The film stars Alan Alda, Michael Caine, Bill Cosby, Jane Fonda, Walter
Matthau, Elaine May, Richard Pryor and Maggie Smith.

14
01:15:53,684 --> 01:15:59,684
The movie was released in December 1978, and received mixed reviews.

15
01:21:18,947 --> 01:21:24,947
It received three Academy Award nominations, including Best Adapted Screenplay
for Simon, with Maggie Smith winning Best Supporting Actress.

16
01:26:44,210 --> 01:26:50,210
Smith also won the Golden Globe Award for Best Actress in a Motion Picture – Musical or
Comedy, and the film was nominated for Best Motion Picture – Musical or Comedy.

